  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the sliced shiitake mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown",
    "Add the kombu cold extract, salt, black pepper, and paprika, and stir to combine",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a simmer",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let cook for 10 minutes",
    "Serve hot and enjoy"
